## Q44. Find customers whose approved loan amount is more than 10 times their monthly income.

Expected output:

```text
customer_id | customer_name | monthly_income | total_approved_loan_amount | income_multiple
with cte as (select    c.customer_id as customer_id, c.customer_name as customer_name, c.monthly_income as monthly_income
 ,(c.monthly_income*10) as income_multiple ,a.loan_amount as total_approved_loan_amount,a.loan_status as status from customers
as c inner join loan_amount as a on a.customer_id=c.customer_id )
select  customer_id , customer_name ,  monthly_income , total_approved_loan_amount , income_multiple where status ='approved' and total_approved_loan_amount>income_multiple